<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Abercrombie &amp; Fitch starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Abercrombie &amp; Fitch starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Steve Kernkraut has started coverage of Abercrombie &amp; Fitch Co with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Columbus, Ohio, retail clothing company opened up 1-3/8 to 15.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
